{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/1-en_US.gif?t=1753394265\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Cozyrama, you can create the perfect world just the way you imagine. Start from its shape, then pick the right color and have fun with decorations. Would you like to build a cozy village or a colorful garden? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/2-en_US.gif?t=1753394265\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no time limit and no competition. Immerse yourself in a beautiful and imaginative world that feels like a warm hug. Watch cute animals wandering around, and pet them if you like. Whether for a few minutes or a few hours, it's a place where you can unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/3-en_US.gif?t=1753394265\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also design and decorate the world inside the picture. Add charming decorations such as lanterns, benches, and little animal friends, to bring the surroundings to life. Whether you prefer a bright and lively space or a quiet, starlit night, this world is yours to shape. Create your peaceful oasis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3133020?t=1753394265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753394265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/e644ba436e48a925ffff450a6d61bdcd10c9fd75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753394265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/e644ba436e48a925ffff450a6d61bdcd10c9fd75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753394265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/1-en_US.gif?t=1753394265\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Cozyrama, you can create the perfect world just the way you imagine. Start from its shape, then pick the right color and have fun with decorations. Would you like to build a cozy village or a colorful garden? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/2-en_US.gif?t=1753394265\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no time limit and no competition. Immerse yourself in a beautiful and imaginative world that feels like a warm hug. Watch cute animals wandering around, and pet them if you like. Whether for a few minutes or a few hours, it's a place where you can unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133020/extras/3-en_US.gif?t=1753394265\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also design and decorate the world inside the picture. Add charming decorations such as lanterns, benches, and little animal friends, to bring the surroundings to life. Whether you prefer a bright and lively space or a quiet, starlit night, this world is yours to shape. Create your peaceful oasis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Sandwich Gam